  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Mission to Ghana and C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire&apos;s SARA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this mission follows upon earlier efforts in the combi-tracks and at previous SARA editions as described below (&#x2018;Strategische inbedding in combi-track&#x2019;) and focuses on the creation of business opportunities for Dutch companies specifically in both Ghana as C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire.The mission kicks off in Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire, where companies will attend the SARA in Abidjan, where matchmaking events and exposure of the Dutch sector to potential partners in West Africa will be organised. A limited number of site visits &#x2013; linked to the combitracks &#x2013; will be considered as part of the final programme.Companies will then travel to Ghana where Dutch companies are exposed to commercial opportunities in the horticultural value chain and linked to the horticultural network set up by the Netherlands embassy.The mission provides the Dutch business community with an opportunity to explore potential gaps in the market, offer their services and make connections that will benefit both the Dutch as well as the West African markets.</narrative>
  </description>
